# No API keys or model provider are required or consumed.
# MCP child-process policy is controlled by the dashboard; default deny.
# For manual `tsx server/mcp.ts` only: DEMO_ALLOW_WRITES=true
# Playwright defaults to the project-local browser install:
PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSERS_PATH=.playwright-browsers
# Optional: full path to an existing compatible Chromium executable.
# PLAYWRIGHT_EXECUTABLE_PATH=
